ne-walks/
# MIB modules stay local: they are the vendors' and the IETF's copyright. tools/mib/collect_mibs.py rebuilds the
# folder from the Observium CE archive and SHA256SUMS checks it; only those two files are published.
mib/*
!mib/README.md
!mib/SHA256SUMS
